{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An open world survival game by  a solo hobbyist dev in development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704950/extras/a9f349066a04725cc710b6c4f07b123d.poster.avif?t=1772151623\" width=512 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704950/extras/a9f349066a04725cc710b6c4f07b123d.webm?t=1772151623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704950/extras/a9f349066a04725cc710b6c4f07b123d.mp4?t=1772151623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander endless islands, salvage supplies, craft, build, fish, hunt and scavenge with fixed or procedurally generated maps. Play various sandbox scenarios from nothing to high tech weaponry. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704950/extras/a2fa08a9ca1bb62cb4971f6a9261c5c2.poster.avif?t=1772151623\" width=512 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704950/extras/a2fa08a9ca1bb62cb4971f6a9261c5c2.webm?t=1772151623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704950/extras/a2fa08a9ca1bb62cb4971f6a9261c5c2.mp4?t=1772151623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features you as a downed pilot survivor on a procedurally generated map with various diverse biomes for different challenges. Swim, dive, collect supplies and fight to survive against animals, environment, or circumstances. Contents of each biome and individual resources specific to that region. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704950/extras/c7188a1ca2d8af31a0270f593e8e67f6.poster.avif?t=1772151623\" width=512 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704950/extras/c7188a1ca2d8af31a0270f593e8e67f6.webm?t=1772151623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704950/extras/c7188a1ca2d8af31a0270f593e8e67f6.mp4?t=1772151623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive your way: Solo, with friends, or strangers.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2704950?t=1772151623","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2704950?t=1772151623","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704950/3058af6bfb3bb42a40dfcf45bcbbfbe4588f922d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772151623","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704950/3058af6bfb3bb42a40dfcf45bcbbfbe4588f922d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772151623","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game may contain instances of violence against animals and weapons."},"demos":[{"appid":4093150,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An open world sur